# ISS Notification System

A Python automation project that tracks the International Space Station (ISS) location using an API and sends notifications based on visibility conditions.

## Features

- Retrieves real-time ISS location data through an API
- Processes and stores ISS position data in CSV format
- Visualizes ISS trajectory on a world map
- Supports automated execution using scheduling methods (e.g., GitHub Actions)

## Technologies

Python | API | JSON | CSV | GitHub Actions | Data Visualization

## Notes

The script can be automated using different scheduling approaches; like, pythonanywhere website, infinite while, github action and etc.
In my implementation, I used GitHub Actions to run the workflow automatically.
